Package: flyos-base
Version: @VERSION@
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Fly OS Project <devnull@example.invalid>
Depends: flyos-core (= @VERSION@), flyos-shell (= @VERSION@), flyos-center (= @VERSION@), flyos-search (= @VERSION@), flyos-update (= @VERSION@), flyos-recovery (= @VERSION@), flyos-privacy (= @VERSION@), flyos-performance (= @VERSION@), flyos-wine (= @VERSION@), flyos-branding (= @VERSION@), flyos-repo (= @VERSION@)
Description: Fly OS complete desktop metapackage
 Installs the complete Fly OS native Wayland desktop stack. The visible desktop,
 search, settings, update/recovery layer, Windows compatibility and branding are
 owned by Fly OS while upstream Linux components remain replaceable layers.
